@bogdansurdu It would probably be safer to have some adapter class to calculate the series of grouped metrics:
```python
class GroupByMetricAdapter(ThreeColumnVector):
    def __init__(self, metric: TwoColumnMetric):
        self.metric = metric

    def __call__(sr_a: pd.Series, sr_b: pd.Series, sr_c: pd.Series) -> pd.Series:
        df = pd.DataFrame({sr_a.name: sr_a, sr_b.name: sr_b, sr_c.name: sr_c})

        def apply_metric(df):
            return self.metric(df[sr_a.name], df[sr_b.name])

        return df.groupby(sr_c.name).apply(apply_metric).explode()

```

